c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_e35d6949a46a24812957505f1c406f6c0592d060.600x338.jpg?t=1771026872"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_b7da833ef4f2d2d9aa7e97e86aa76345aaf0bcdd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771026872","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_b7da833ef4f2d2d9aa7e97e86aa76345aaf0bcdd.600x338.jpg?t=1771026872"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_26c6f52f2b035a4fa51e27c241c4cb60e831cc3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771026872","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_26c6f52f2b035a4fa51e27c241c4cb60e831cc3d.600x338.jpg?t=1771026872"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_9c14a2bb97d98e1e20f353f28041e961fa7afa2e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771026872","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292510/ss_9c14a2bb97d98e1e20f353f28041e961fa7afa2e.600x338.jpg?t=1771026872"}],"short_description":"Classic MOBA combat meets battle royale PVP, with roguelite elements. Fight other players, customize your abilities and survive hordes of monsters long enough to face the final boss. The last team standing wins. Earn permanent upgrades in between matches, then dive back in for more.","steam_appid":1292510,"support_info":{"email":"murg@thousandhour.com","url":"https://www.everstorm.gg"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain, German, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://everstorm.gg/"}